 "final_summary": "The open_count statistic was incorrectly limited to only 'open' status tasks. The fix changed it to total - finished (where finished includes 'done' and 'closed'), so it now correctly counts all unfinished tasks including 'in_progress' and 'blocked'. This ensures the task statistics accurately reflect the number of active tasks.",
